description:
We have received repeated feedback from support that they'd like us to start labeling Workbench CLI command by whether or not it requires root (the errors do indicate that something requires root but it would be good for the user to know ahead of time vs. trial and error).

Instead of using HTML / a bootstrap <i> icon, we are adding it as a "tier" so it can be easily circulated and used (in a standardized way) across teams, if they choose.

To use the icon, simply: `{{< tier shield >}}
